    </thead><tbody>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1261206">F3 0F 2C /r</para>
      <para unique="1261207">CVTTSS2SI r32, xmm1/m32</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261211">A</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261213">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261215">SSE</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261217">Convert one single precision floating-point value from xmm1/m32 to one signed doubleword integer in r32 using truncation.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1261219">F3 REX.W 0F 2C /r</para>
      <para unique="1261220">CVTTSS2SI r64, xmm1/m32</para>
