     <td><para unique="1261228">SSE</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261230">Convert one single precision floating-point value from xmm1/m32 to one signed quadword integer in r64 using truncation.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1261235">VEX.LIG.F3.0F.W0 2C /r <footnote><para unique="1261234" format="TableFootnote">Software should ensure VCVTTSS2SI is encoded with VEX.L=0. Encoding VCVTTSS2SI with VEX.L=1 may encounter unpredictable behavior across different processor generations.</para>
        </footnote></para>
      <para unique="1261236">VCVTTSS2SI r32, xmm1/m32</para>
