     <td><para unique="1261771">AVX512F</para>
      <para unique="1261775">OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+986767"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261777">Convert one single precision floating-point value from xmm1/m32 to one signed doubleword integer in r32 using truncation.</para>
      </td>
