     <td><para unique="1261791">AVX512F</para>
      <para unique="1261792">OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+633339"/> </para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261794">Convert one single precision floating-point value from xmm1/m32 to one signed quadword integer in r64 using truncation.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    </tbody>
